</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_40\">॥</span></span> <details class=\"ap-tk\"><summary>मितप्रकाशविवृतिः</summary><div class=\"ap-tkb\"> <span class=\"tk-prat\" data-jb=\"1.1.3\" data-lemma=\"शौनको ह वै महाशालोऽङ्गिरसं विधिवदुपसन्नः पप्रच्छ कस्मिन्नु भगवो विज्ञाते सर्वमिदं विज्ञातं भवती\" data-jmo=\"1\" data-jpin=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:0\" data-jpinw=\"शौनकः\" data-jmt=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:0\">\" <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_41\"><span class=\"bhsj\">शौनको</span><span class=\"bhsp\">शौनकः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_42\">ह</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_43\">वै</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_44\"><span class=\"bhsj\">महाशालोऽङ्गिरसं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">महाशालः अङ्गिरसम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_45\"><span class=\"bhsj\">विधिवदुपसन्नः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">विधिवत् उपसन्नः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_46\">पप्रच्छ</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_47\"><span class=\"bhsj\">कस्मिन्नु</span><span class=\"bhsp\">कस्मिन् नु</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_48\"><span class=\"bhsj\">भगवो</span><span class=\"bhsp\">भगवः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_49\">विज्ञाते</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_50\"><span class=\"bhsj\">सर्वमिदं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">सर्वम् इदम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_51\"><span class=\"bhsj\">विज्ञातं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">विज्ञातम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_52\">भवती</span> \"</span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_53\">त्येतद्व्याचष्टे</span> - <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_54\">चतुरित्यादिपद्यद्वयेन</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:t