<span class=\"bhsp\">कस्मिन् नु</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_48\"><span class=\"bhsj\">भगवो</span><span class=\"bhsp\">भगवः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_49\">विज्ञाते</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_50\"><span class=\"bhsj\">सर्वमिदं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">सर्वम् इदम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_51\"><span class=\"bhsj\">विज्ञातं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">विज्ञातम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_52\">भवती</span> \"</span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_53\">त्येतद्व्याचष्टे</span> - <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_54\">चतुरित्यादिपद्यद्वयेन</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_55\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_56\">यथा</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_57\"><span class=\"bhsj\">शास्त्रमित्यस्योपसद्येत्यनेन</span><span class=\"bhsp\">शास्त्रम् इति अस्य उपसद्य इति अनेन</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_58\">सम्बन्धः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_59\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_60\"><span class=\"bhsj\">एतमङ्गिरसम्</span><span class=\"bhsp\">एतम् अङ्गिरसम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_61\">॥</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_62\">२</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_63\">॥</span></span> </div></details></div></div></div>","<div class=\"tk-inline\" data-side=\"anubhuti\" data-label=\"अनुभूतिप्रकाशः\"><span class=\"tk-grp\" data-jgrp=\"2\" data-gs=\"anubhuti\"></span><span class=\"ap-hd\">श्लोकाः ६।३–४ · मु १।१।४–५</span> <span class=\"ap-sl\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_0\"><span class=\"bhsj\">एकस्मिन्विदिते</span><span class=\"bhsp\">एकस्मिन् विदिते</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_1\" data-g=\"anubhuti\" data-flag>सर्व</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_2\"><span class=\"bhsj\">विज्ञातमिति</span><span class=\"bhsp\">विज्ञातम् इति</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_3\">वैदिकी</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_4\">।</span></span> <span class=\"ap-sl\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_5\"><span class=\"bhsj\">प्रसिद्धिरस्ति</span><span class=\"bhsp\">प्रसिद्धिः अस्ति</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_6\"><span class=\"bhsj\">तद्वस्तु</span><span class=\"bhsp\">तत्-वस्तु</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_7\"><span class=\"bhsj\">किं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">किम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_8\"><span class=\"bhsj\">स्यान्निश्चित्य</span><span class=\"bhsp\">स्यात् निश्चित्य</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_9\">मे</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_10\">वद</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_11\">॥</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_12\">३</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_13\">॥</span></span> <details class=\"ap-tk\"><summary>मितप्रकाशविवृतिः</summary><div class=\"ap-tkb\"> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_14\"><span class=\"bhsj\">वैदिकीति</span><span class=\"bhsp\">वैदिकी इति</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_15\">।</span> \" <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_16\"><span class=\"bhsj\">येनाश्रुतं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">येन अश्रुतम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_17\"><span class=\"bhsj\">श्रुतं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">श्रुतम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_18\"><span class=\"bhsj\">भवत्यमतं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">भवति अमतम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_19\">मतमविज्ञातंविज्ञात</span> \" <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_20\">मिति</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_21\">श्रुतिः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_22\">॥</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_23\">३</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_24\">॥</span></span> </div></details> <span class=\"ap-sl\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_25\">शृणु</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_26\">विद्ये</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_27\">उभे</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_28\"><span class=\"bhsj\">तावद्वेदितव्ये</span><span class=\"bhsp\">तावत् वेदितव्ये</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_29\"><span class=\"bhsj\">परापरे</span><span class=\"bhsp\">परा-अपरे</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_30\">।</span></span> <span class=\"ap-sl\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_31\"><span class=\"bhsj\">पृष्टं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">पृष्टम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_32\">वस्तु</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_33\"><span class=\"bhsj\">तयोर्मध्ये</span><span class=\"bhsp\">तयोः मध्ये</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_34\">गम्यते</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_35\"><span class=\"bhsj\">परविद्यया</span><span class=\"bhsp\">पर-विद्यया</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_36\">॥</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_37\">४</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_38\">॥</span></span> <details class=\"ap-tk\"><summary>मितप्रकाशविवृतिः</summary><div class=\"ap-tkb\"> <span class=\"tk-prat\" data-jb=\"1.1.5\" data-lemma=\"तस्मै सहोवाच द्वेविद्येवेदितव्ये\" data-jmo=\"1\" data-jpin=\"Mundaka:1.1.4:0\" data-jpinw=\"तस्मै\" data-jmt=\"Mundaka:1.1.4:0\">\" <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_39\">तस्मै</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_40\"><span class=\"bhsj\">सहोवाच</span><span class=\"bhsp\">सः ह उवाच</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_41\"><span class=\"bhsj\">द्वेविद्येवेदितव्ये</span><span class=\"bhsp\">द्वे विद्ये वेदितव्ये</span></span> \"</span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_42\">इत्यादे</span></span> <span class=\"tk-prat\" data-jb=\"1.1.5\" data-lemma=\"रथ परा यया तदक्षरमधिगम्यते\" data-jmo=\"1\" data-jpin=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:13\" data-jpinw=\"अथ\" data-jmt=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:13\">\" <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_43\">रथ</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_44\">परा</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_45\">यया</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_46\"><span class=\"bhsj\">तदक्षरमधिगम्यते</span><span class=\"bhsp\">तत् अक्षरम् अधिगम्यते</span></span> \"</span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_47\">इत्यन्तस्य</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_48\"><span class=\"bhsj\">तात्पर्यमाह</span><span class=\"bhsp\">तात्पर्यम् आह</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_49\">शृण्वित्यादिपद्यसप्तकेन</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_50\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_51\"><span class=\"bhsj\">पृष्टमित्यस्य</span><span class=\"bhsp\">पृष्टम् इति अस्य</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_52\"><span class=\"bhsj\">त्वयेति</span><span class=\"bhsp\">त्वया इति</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_53\">शेषः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_54\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_55\">तयोः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_56\"><span class=\"bhsj\">परापरविद्ययोः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">परा-अपर-विद्ययोः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_57\">॥</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_58\">४</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_59\">॥</span></span> </div></details></div>","<div class=\"side-zone\" data-side=\"anubhuti\"><div class=\"zlabel\">अनुभूतिप्रकाशः</div><div class=\"tika dv\"><div class=\"tk\"><span class=\"tk-grp\" data-jgrp=\"2\" data-gs=\"anubhuti\"></span><span class=\"ap-hd\">श्लोकाः ६।३–४ · मु १।१।४–५</span> <span class=\"ap-sl\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_0\"><span class=\"bhsj\">एकस्मिन्विदिते</span><span class=\"bhsp\">एकस्मिन् विदिते</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_1\" data-g=\"anubhuti\" data-flag>सर्व</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_2\"><span class=\"bhsj\">विज्ञातमिति</span><span class=\"bhsp\">विज्ञातम् इति</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_3\">वैदिकी</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_4\">।</span></span> <span class=\"ap-sl\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_5\"><span class=\"bhsj\">प्रसिद्धिरस्ति</span><span class=\"bhsp\">प्रसिद्धिः अस्ति</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_6\"><span class=\"bhsj\">तद्वस्तु</span><span class=\"bhsp\">तत्-वस्तु</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_7\"><span class=\"bhsj\">किं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">किम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_8\"><span class=\"bhsj\">स्यान्निश्चित्य</span><span class=\"bhsp\">स्यात् निश्चित्य</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_9\">मे</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_10\">वद</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_11\">॥</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_12\">३</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_13\">॥</span></span> <details class=\"ap-tk\"><summary>मितप्रकाशविवृतिः</summary><div class=\"ap-tkb\"> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_14\"><span class=\"bhsj\">वैदिकीति</span><span class=\"bhsp\">वैदिकी इति</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_15\">।</span> \" <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_16\"><span class=\"bhsj\">येनाश्रुतं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">येन अश्रुतम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_17\"><span class=\"bhsj\">श्रुतं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">श्रुतम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_18\"><span class=\"bhsj\">भवत्यमतं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">भवति अमतम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_19\">मतमविज्ञातंविज्ञात</span> \" <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_20\">मिति</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_21\">श्रुतिः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_22\">॥</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_23\">३</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_24\">॥</span></span> </div></details> <span class=\"ap-sl\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_25\">शृणु</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_26\">विद्ये</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_27\">उभे</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_28\"><span class=\"bhsj\">तावद्वेदितव्ये</span><span class=\"bhsp\">तावत् वेदितव्ये</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_29\"><span class=\"bhsj\">परापरे</span><span class=\"bhsp\">परा-अपरे</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mun