\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_46\"><span class=\"bhsj\">तदक्षरमधिगम्यते</span><span class=\"bhsp\">तत् अक्षरम् अधिगम्यते</span></span> \"</span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_47\">इत्यन्तस्य</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_48\"><span class=\"bhsj\">तात्पर्यमाह</span><span class=\"bhsp\">तात्पर्यम् आह</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_49\">शृण्वित्यादिपद्यसप्तकेन</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_50\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_51\"><span class=\"bhsj\">पृष्टमित्यस्य</span><span class=\"bhsp\">पृष्टम् इति अस्य</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_52\"><span class=\"bhsj\">त्वयेति</span><span class=\"bhsp\">त्वया इति</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_53\">शेषः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_54\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_55\">तयोः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_56\"><span class=\"bhsj\">परापरविद्ययोः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">परा-अपर-विद्ययोः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_57\">॥</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_58\">४</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_59\">॥</span></span> </div></details></div></div></div>"],"gt":{"सर्व":["","","","printed «सर्व» — probably «सर्वं» (a misprint in the print, shown as printed)"]}}